# cyto genome exported from cell 4 — load it via Load Genome (rename to cyto-brush.gene).
Break bb : Biomass < 4000 : Convert bb @15
Light : 0 < 1984 : FormBond b b
Break bb : ab < a & ab < 975 & ac < 5000 : FormBond a c @13
Break ac : a < ac & a < 975 : FormBond a b @13
Break ab : ac < ab & ac < 975 : Contract @6
